        "title": "On-meter spend ceiling skips elevated country and trust level budgets",
        "summary": "resolveFreebuffSpendCeiling in common/src/constants/freebuff-spend-ceilings.ts now excludes elevated_country and trust_level cohorts when onFreebucksMeter is true. This prevents lower session-era ceilings from incorrectly blocking accounts with remaining Freebucks. Abuse cohorts remain active as fences. Fixes false exhaustion reports for 57 accounts on 2026-09-05.",
